      <h1 style="margin-top:10px">Badminton club night formats compared: what each system optimises</h1>
      <p class="lede">There is no clever format that simultaneously maximises court-time equality, competitive reward, player choice, perfect game balance and zero administration. Choose which trade-off your night is supposed to make.</p>
